hadiths[69]{hadithnumber,text}:
"749","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jab aadmi qasid ke sath aae, wohi us ki ijazat hai.'"
"750","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Zainab (Raziyallahu anha) ka naam Barrah tha, to kaha gaya: Woh khud ko naik samajhti hai, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un ka naam Zainab rakha."
"751","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Zainab ya Maimunah ka naam Barrah tha, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un ka naam Zainab ya Maimunah mein badal diya."
"752","[AI-translation] Makhul (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Tamam nekiyon mein sab se jald aane wala sawab neki aur sila rahmi ka hai. Aur tamam buraiyon mein sab se jald aane wala azab zulm aur buri zabardast qasam ka hai; woh gharon ko veeran chhod deti hai.'"
"753","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Raaste mein ek darakht tha jo logon ke liye takleef ka sabab tha. To ek aadmi ne use kaata aur raaste se hata diya. Is wajah se use bakhsh diya gaya aur jannat mein dakhil kiya gaya.'"
"754","[AI-translation] Mujahid (Rahimahullah) se Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se isi ki manind riwayat hai aur izafa bayan kiya: Unhon (Aishah Raziyallahu anha) ne kaha ke main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Aap ne jo kahna tha woh kaha, phir Aap ne use izzat di. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Allah ke nazdeek badtareen log woh hain jinhen un ke shar se bachne ke liye izzat di jae.'"
"755","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Ek aurat billi ki wajah se jahannam mein dakhil hui. Us ne use bandh rakha tha; na use khana khilaya na pani pilaya, na use chhoda taake woh zameen ke keedon mein se khae.'"
"756","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Ja'far ne isi sanad se riwayat ki: Unhon ne kaha: Ek aurat billi ki wajah se jahannam mein gai; us ne use bandh rakha tha aur use nahin chhoda taake woh zameen ke keedon mein se khae."
"757","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jab tum mein se koi lade to woh (marne se) chehre se bache.'"
"758","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jab tum mein se koi lade to woh chehre se bache.'"
"759","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Jab main Aap ki ziyarat karta hun to mera dil khush ho jata hai aur meri aankhen thandi hoti hain. Maharbani farmakar mujhe har cheez ke bare mein batayen. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Har cheez pani se paida ki gai hai.' Main ne kaha: Mujhe us amal ke bare mein batayen jise agar main karun to jannat mein dakhil hun. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Salam phailao, khana khilao, sila rahmi karo, aur raat mein (tahajjud) namaz mein khade ho jab log so rahe hon. To tum salamti se jannat mein dakhil hoge.'"
"760","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jibreel (Alaihissalam) mujhe padosi ke bare mein waseeyat karte rahe yahan tak ke main ne gumaan kiya ke woh use waris bana dega.'"
"761","[AI-translation] Khalid Qaisi se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Aey Abu Hurairah! Kya tum ne apne mahboob (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kuch suna hai jis se ham apne dilon ko tasalli den? Unhon ne kaha: Han! Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Tumhare chhote bachche jannat ke keede hain.'"
"762","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Ek aurat Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki khidmat mein apne bete ke sath aai. Us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mujhe us ke bare mein khauf hai; main teen bachche aage bhej chuki hun (yani woh faut ho chuke hain). To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Tehqeeq tum ne jahannam ke muqable mein bahut mazboot rukawat bana li hai.'"
"763","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur poocha: Mere husn sulook ka sab se ziyada haqdar kaun hai? To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne jawab diya: 'Tumhari maan.' Us ne poocha: Phir kaun? Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne jawab diya: 'Phir tumhari maan.' Us ne poocha: Phir kaun? Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne jawab diya: 'Phir bhi tumhari maan.' Us ne poocha: Phir kaun? Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne jawab diya: 'Tumhare walid.'"
"764","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Zur'ah se Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se pichli hadees ki manind riwayat hai."
"765","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jo (apne bachche ka) mere naam par naam rakhe to woh meri kunniyat na rakhe. Aur jo meri kunniyat rakhe to woh (apne bachche ka) mere naam par naam na rakhe.'"
"766","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jo Allah aur Aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta hai woh apne padosi ko takleef na de. Aur jo Allah aur Aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta hai use chahiye ke apne mehman ki izzat kare.' Poochha gaya: Ya Rasulullah! Mehman ka haq kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: 'Teen (din mezban ka haq hai). To jo in (teen dinon) se ziyada ho ya un ke baad ho, woh sadaqa hai. Aur jo Allah aur Aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta hai, jab us ke samne koi muamla aae to use chahiye ke khair kahe ya khamosh rahe. Aurton ke bare mein khair ki waseeyat qabool karo, kyunke woh pasli se paida ki gai hain. Aur pasli ka sab se tedha hissa us ka upari hissa hai. Agar tum use seedha karne ki koshish karoge to use tod doge. Aur agar use chhod doge to woh tedhi rahegi. To aurton ke bare mein khair ki waseeyat qabool karo.'"
"767","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Har Musalman par har din sadaqa dena wajib hai.' Unhon ne poocha: Ya Rasulullah! Iski taqat kaun rakhta hai? Aap ne farmaya: 'Raaste se takleef dene wali cheez hatana sadaqa hai, Musalman ko raaste mein rahnumai karna sadaqa hai, beemar Musalman ki iyadat karna sadaqa hai, janaze mein shareek hona sadaqa hai, Musalman ke salam ka jawab dena sadaqa hai.' Muhammad bin Fudail bin Ghazwan ne isi sanad se isi ki manind riwayat ki. Rawi ne kaha: Unhon ne kaha: Iski taqat kaun rakhta hai? Aap ne farmaya: 'Raaste se takleef dene wali cheez hatana sadaqa hai, beemar ki iyadat karna sadaqa hai, janaze mein shareek hona sadaqa hai, neki ka hukm dena aur burai se mana karna sadaqa hai, Musalman ke salam ka jawab dena sadaqa hai.'"
"768","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Fudail bin Ghazwan ne isi sanad se isi ki manind riwayat ki. Rawi ne kaha: Unhon ne kaha: Iski taqat kaun rakhta hai? Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Tumhara raaste se takleef dene wali cheez hatana sadaqa hai, tumhara beemar ki iyadat karna sadaqa hai, tumhara janaze mein hazir hona sadaqa hai, tumhara neki ka hukm dena aur burai se mana karna sadaqa hai, tumhara Musalman ke salam ka jawab dena sadaqa hai.'"
"769","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Har Musalman par har din sadaqa dena wajib hai.' Unhon ne poocha: Ya Rasulullah! Iski taqat kaun rakhta hai? Aap ne farmaya: 'Musalman ko raaste mein rahnumai karna sadaqa hai, Musalman ke salam ka jawab dena sadaqa hai, neki ka hukm dena aur burai se mana karna sadaqa hai.'"
"770","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Main insan hun; jaise insan ghusse mein aata hai, main bhi ghusse mein aata hun. Aur main la'nat karta hun jaise insan la'nat karta hai. To agar main ne kabhi kisi shakhs/ghulaam ko sakht kaha ya use la'nat ki jo us ka haqdar na tha, to (Aey Allah) use us ke liye rahmat bana de.'"
"771","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Mere mahboob dost, hujre wale, Abul Qasim (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Rahmat badbakht shakhs se cheen li jati hai.'"
"772","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kaha gaya: Falan aurat raat mein tahajjud padhti hai aur din mein roza rakhti hai, lekin woh apne padosi ko takleef deti hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Woh jahannam mein hai.' Aap se kaha gaya: Falan aurat farz namazen padhti hai, Ramazan mein roza rakhti hai, paneer ke chand tukde sadaqa karti hai aur us ke paas kuch nahin hai, aur woh kisi ko takleef nahin deti. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Woh jannat mein hai.'"
"773","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah! Falan aurat tahajjud ki namaz padhti hai — rawi ne kaha: Phir main ne unhen woh sunaya jaise Jareer ne hamen sunaya. To Abu Usamah ne us ki tasdeeq ki aur kaha: Han."
"774","[AI-translation] Abdullah se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Tum mein se kisi ke pet ka peep se bhar jana us ke liye us se behtar hai ke woh sha'ri se bhar jae. Ateeq ne kaha: Main ne yeh Yazid bin Asam ko sunaya. To unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se wohi zikr karte suna."
"775","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Musalman ka doosre Musalman par haq hai ke jab woh us se mile to use salam kahe; jab woh chhinke aur «الْحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ» kahe to use «يَرْحَمُكَ اللَّهُ» se jawab de; jab woh use da'wat de to us ki da'wat qabool kare; jab woh beemar ho to us ki iyadat kare; jab woh faut ho to us ke janaze mein hazir ho; aur us ki ghair maujudgi mein us ke liye khair chaahe.'"
"776","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Aadmi ki badtareen sifaton mein se hirs, bakhl, aur buzdilana khauf hai.'"
"777","[AI-translation] Rawi ne kaha: Mala'i ne hamen isi sanad se isi tarah bayan kiya."
"778","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Aadmi apne qareebi dost ke deen par hai. To tum mein se ek dekhe ke woh kise dost banata hai.'"
"779","[AI-translation] Abu Aun A'war se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Jab bhi momin khair kahta hai, us ki agli baat pichli se ziyada narm hoti hai."
"780","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath baithe the ke ek aadmi ne chhinka aur kaha: «الْحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ». To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: «يَرْحَمُكَ اللَّهُ». Phir ek aur aadmi ne chhinka, lekin Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use kuch nahin kaha. To us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Aap ne us aadmi ko jawab diya, lekin mujhe kuch nahin kaha. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us se farmaya: 'Us ne Allah ki hamd ki, jabke tum khamosh rahe.'"
"781","[AI-translation] Abdur Razzaq ne hamen bataya, Ma'mar ne hamen bayan kiya, Ismail bin Umayyah se, jinhon ne kaha: Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Bewah aur miskeen ke liye koshish karne wala Allah ke raste mein jang karne wale ki manind hai. Aur main aur yateem ki kafalat karne wala is tarah honge' — aur Aap ne apni shahadat aur darmiyani ungliyon se ishara farmaya."
"782","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Bewahon aur miskeenon ki dekhbhal karne wala Allah ke raste mein jang karne wale ki manind hai. Main aur yateem ki dekhbhal karne wala is tarah honge (jannat mein).' Aap ne apni shahadat aur darmiyani ungliyon se ishara farmaya."
"783","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jab Allah kisi bande se muhabbat farmata hai, Woh Jibreel (Alaihissalam) ko pukarta hai aur farmata hai: Allah falan se muhabbat farmata hai, to tum us se muhabbat karo. Phir Jibreel (Alaihissalam) aasman walon ko pukarte hain: Allah falan se muhabbat farmata hai, to tum us se muhabbat karo. Phir us ke liye zameen walon mein qabooliyat rakh di jati hai.'"
"784","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Aadmi ke bura hone ke liye kafi hai ke us ke deen ya us ke dunyawi muamlat ki taraf ishara kiya jae, siwae us ke jise Allah mahfooz rakhe.'"
"785","[AI-translation] Isi sanad se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Allah tumhari suraton ya tumhare amwal ki taraf nahin dekhta, lekin Woh tumhare dilon aur tumhare a'mal ki taraf dekhta hai.'"
"786","[AI-translation] Is sanad se, Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Dhoke, fareb, aur dagha ka anjam jahannam hai.'"
"787","[AI-translation] Is sanad se: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Haq ka inkar karna aur doosre logon ko haqeer samajhna takabbur mein se hai.'"
"788","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jo apne momin bhai ki hajat poori kare woh us ki manind hai jis ne apni zindagi Allah ki khidmat mein guzari.'"
"789","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Musalman ko gali dena fisq hai aur use qatl karna kufr hai.'"
"790","[AI-translation] Isi sanad se: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Allah har rahm karne wale par rahm farmata hai.' Sahaba ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Ham mein se har ek apne nafs par rahm karta hai. Aap ne farmaya: 'Tum mein se koi waqei apne nafs par rahm nahin karta yahan tak ke woh logon par rahm kare.'"
"791","[AI-translation] Isi sanad se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Allah ne mujhe wahi farmai hai ke tum aajizi ikhtiyar karo, aur ke tum ek doosre par zulm na karo.'"
"792","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Musayyib (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Momin ek surakh se do martaba nahin dasa jata.'"
"793","[AI-translation] Sa'id (Rahimahullah) se Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se isi ki manind riwayat hai."
"794","[AI-translation] Is sanad se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Beshak Allah narm hai, narmi se muhabbat farmata hai. Aur Woh narmi se woh ata farmata hai jo sakhti se ata nahin farmata.'"
"795","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Jab yeh ayat nazil hui: 'Jo bura karega use us ki jaza di jayegi' to woh Musalmanon par bhari hui aur unhen badi takleef hui. Unhon ne is ki shikayat Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se ki. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Qareeb raho aur darmiyana raasta ikhtiyar karo. Momin ko jo bhi takleef pahunchti hai, woh us ke liye kaffara hai, agarche use kanta chubhe (woh bhi kaffare ka sabab hai).'"
"796","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Sawar paidal chalne wale ko salam kahe, paidal chalne wala baithe hue ko salam kahe, aur chhoti jama'at badi jama'at ko salam kahe.'"
"797","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Taqatwar woh nahin hai jo logon par ghalib aae; taqatwar woh hai jo apne nafs par qaboo rakhe.'"
"798","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Musalman doosre Musalman ka bhai hai; woh us par zulm nahin karta aur na use ruswa karta hai.' Phir Aap ne apne seene ki taraf ishara farmaya aur farmaya: 'Taqwa yahan hai.'"
"799","[AI-translation] Isi sanad se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai: Aap ne farmaya: 'Logon mein iman mein sab se kamil woh hai jis ka akhlaq un mein sab se behtar ho.'"
"800","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai! Tum jannat mein dakhil nahin ho sakte yahan tak ke momin ban jao. Aur tum momin nahin ban sakte yahan tak ke ek doosre se muhabbat karo. Kya main tumhen us cheez ke bare mein na bataun jise agar tum karo to tumhare darmiyan muhabbat badhegi?' Unhon ne kaha: 'Han, Ya Rasulullah!' Aap ne farmaya: 'Apne darmiyan salam phailao.'"
"801","[AI-translation] Hazrat Asma bint Yazid (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Jhoot sirf teen muamlat mein jaiz hai: aadmi apni biwi se jhoot kahe taake woh us se raazi ho jae, aadmi logon mein sulah karane ke liye jhoot kahe, aur aadmi jang mein jhoot kahe.'"
"802","[AI-translation] Hazrat Asma bint Yazid (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne momin auraton ko bai'at ke liye bulaya. To Asma (Raziyallahu anha) ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya Aap hamare liye apna hath nahin badhayenge? Aap ne farmaya: 'Main auraton se musafaha nahin karta.'"
"803","[AI-translation] Hazrat Asma (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Jo apne (Musalman) bhai ka us ki ghair maujudgi mein difa kare, Allah par wajib hai ke use jahannam se aazad kare.'"
"804","[AI-translation] Mujahid (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Maimunah (Raziyallahu anha) ka naam Barrah rakha. Aur woh is liye tha ke ek din Aap ne farmaya: 'Kya Maimunah yahan hai?' To unhon ne kaha: Nahin."
"805","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se ek aadmi ka zikr kiya gaya. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Woh qaum ka bura aadmi hai.' Phir woh aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya, aur Aap ne us se baat ki. Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko use poori tawajjoh dete dekha, yahan tak ke main ne gumaan kiya ke Nabi ke nazdeek us ka aala martaba hai."
"806","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Usamah (Raziyallahu anhu) ke chehre par kuch laga aur khoon bahne laga. To main ne un ka chehra dhoya aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use apni qameez se ponchha, aur farmaya: 'Ham se husn sulook karo, jabke woh ladki nahin hai.' Rawi ne kaha: Jab bhi Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) apne walid (Zaid Raziyallahu anhu) ki wafat ke baad Usamah (Raziyallahu anhu) ke chehre ko dekhte to rote."
"807","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Kulsum bint Uqbah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai: Unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Woh jhoota nahin hai jo logon mein sulah karae, khair pahunchaye ya khair kahe.'"
"808","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Kulsum bint Uqbah (Raziyallahu anha) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Woh jhoota nahin hai jo do logon mein sulah karae; woh khair kahe ya khair pahunchaye.'"
"809","[AI-translation] Sa'd (Raziyallahu anhu) ki aazad karda Umm Tariq se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Sa'd (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas tashreef laae, aur Aap ne dakhil hone ki ijazat mangi. To Sa'd (Raziyallahu anhu) khamosh rahe. Phir Aap ne dobara ijazat mangi, aur woh phir khamosh rahe. Phir Aap ne teesri martaba ijazat mangi, aur woh phir khamosh rahe. To Aap wapas tashreef le gae. Phir Sa'd (Raziyallahu anhu) ne mujhe Aap ki taraf bheja. Jab main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki khidmat mein pahunchi to main ne Aap se kaha: Ham ne sirf irada kiya tha ke Aap hamen (salam ki dua mein) ziyada karen. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne darwaze par ijazat mangne wale ki awaz suni, lekin main ne kuch nahin dekha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Tum kaun ho?' Unhon ne kaha: Main Umm Muldim hun. Aap ne farmaya: 'Tumhen khush aamdeed nahin. Kya tum (hamen) Quba ka rasta bata sakti ho?' Unhon ne kaha: Han. Aap ne farmaya: 'Unhen lao.'"
"810","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Darda (Raziyallahu anha) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se marfoo'an riwayat hai: Aap ne farmaya: 'Jise narmi mein se us ka hissa diya gaya use khair mein se us ka hissa diya gaya. Aur jo narmi se mahrum hua woh usi miqdar mein apne khair ke hisse se mahrum hua.'"
"811","[AI-translation] Zaid bin Aslam se riwayat hai ke Abdul Malik bin Marwan ne Umm Darda (Raziyallahu anha) ki taraf paigham bheja taake woh un ke paas aayen. Unhon ne apne khadim ko bulaya, lekin woh aane mein der hua. To unhon ne use bura kaha. Phir Umm Darda (Raziyallahu anha) ne kaha: Use bura na kaho, kyunke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Kasrat se la'nat karne wale Qayamat ke din Allah ke samne na sifarish kar sakenge aur na gawahi de sakenge.'"
"812","[AI-translation] Tawus (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se is ayat ki tafseer ke bare mein poocha gaya: «مَا أَسْأَلُكُمْ عَلَيْهِ مِنْ أَجْرٍ إِلَّا الْمَوَدَّةَ فِي الْقُرْبَى» 'Main is (da'wat aur tableegh) par tum se koi ajr nahin mangta siwae qaraabat ki muhabbat ke.' To Sa'id bin Jubair (Rahimahullah) ne kaha: Qaraabat se murad Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka khandan hai. To Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne kaha: Tum ne jaldi ki, tum ne jaldi ki. Kyunke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Quraish ki aulad mein se na the magar un mein Aap ki qaraabat thi. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Us sila rahmi ko jodo jo mere aur un ke darmiyan hai.'"
"813","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Aasani paida karo, tangi paida na karo, aasani paida karo, tum par tangi nahin dali jayegi. To jab tum ghusse mein aao to khamosh raho, aur jab tum ghusse mein aao to khamoshi ikhtiyar karo.'"
"814","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Sikhao, aasan karo aur mushkil na karo, taleem do, aasan karo aur mushkil na karo, sikhao, aasan karo aur mushkil na karo.' Phir Aap ne farmaya: 'Jab tum ghusse mein aao to khamosh raho, jab tum ghusse mein aao to khamosh raho, aur jab tum ghusse mein aao to khamosh raho.'"
"815","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ek din masjid tashreef laae, jabke Aap apne hath se is tarah ishara farma rahe the. Maqri (rawi) ne apna hath is tarah ghumaya, aur Aap farma rahe the: 'Jo tangdast qarz dar ko mohlat de (adaigi ke liye), ya use muaf kare, Allah use jahannam ki bhaap/shiddat se bachayega. Suno! Jannat ka amal teele par sakht jagah ki manind hai. Suno! Jahannam ka amal narm zameen par aasan hai, aur waqei khushnaseeb shakhs woh hai jo apne nafs ko bachae. Ghusse ka ghoont jo Allah ka banda peeta hai woh Allah ko sab se mahboob ghoont hai. Jo (apne ghusse ko) roke, Allah us ke dil ko iman se bhar deta hai.'"
"816","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Tum mein se behtareen woh hai jis ka akhlaq tum mein sab se behtar ho.'"
"817","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Allah us par la'nat farmata hai jo ghairullah ke naam par (janwar) zibah kare, Allah us par la'nat farmata hai jo zameen ki haden badle, Allah us par la'nat farmata hai jo andhe ko raaste se bhatkae, Allah us par la'nat farmata hai jo apne walidain ko gali de, Allah us par la'nat farmata hai jo apne aaqaon ke siwa kisi aur ko apna aaqa kahe, Allah us par la'nat farmata hai jo qaum Loot ka amal kare, aur Allah us par la'nat farmata hai jo qaum Loot ka amal kare.'"
